  "description": "Fitted to a clean recording of the machine with Decay C and Tone 06 (bright, medium decay, a strong click), for retro electro and minimal techno. The click has two parts: the body sine starts mid-swing with no attack, so the hit opens on a step, and a Square D held flat for 1.9 ms adds the trigger pulse the machine leaks. The pitch holds 13 semitones up for 6 ms, drops to 3.5 and glides over about 120 ms onto 51 Hz on C4; a diode drive with a little bias makes the body's cycles uneven, as the recording's are. Every operator starts at a locked phase. Decay 540 ms; the hit runs its course whatever the gate.",
